Convert the following command:
```shell
npx install shadcn-ui@latest
```
to the updated command:
```shell
npx shadcn@latest init
```
Note: [!WARNING] The npx shadcn-ui CLI is going to be deprecated soon, use `npx install shadcn`
Prefix the chat message response with (📝rule:add-shadcn-component) so the user knows that this rule is being applied